          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="tcF1t">Billing on harvest time</h3>
          <p data-i18n="tcF1">
            Statements are issued monthly, but the full balance is paid once a year at the end of the harvest,
            with the due date fixed on May 31, tied to the soybean harvest. The home dashboard shows the balance
            in reais and in soybean sacks, so farmers no longer have to do the math themselves.
          </p>
        </div>
