          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="tcF4t">A head start on components</h3>
          <p data-i18n="tcF4">
            Our team built and used a Design Library quickstarter: a file with tokens already bound to components
            and styles like form fields, buttons and headers, so a new client only needed its brand colors and
            details adapted. That head start let me deliver every screen by mid-December, leaving January for App
            Store and Google Play assets and final touches before the card launched on February 28, 2023.
          </p>
